# TEMPLATE: a wish cast as a spell (keys 1 to 4): summoned helpers, a heal,
# a ward, a nova, a bolt.
# Copy this file, then change what it says. Check it with
#   cargo run -p angel-delve --example content_check -- <your file>
#
# Change: the id, the Name, the `say` lines, the spell's lines (summon N
#   swarm|guard|turret, cast bolt|ring|meteor, heal, ward, nova) and each tier's
#   `cooldown <seconds>`, the scroll lines, the summoned creature's picture (at
#   most 16x16, up to 4 frames side by side with `|` between), the card art.
# Keep: `kind spell`; a cooldown on every tier; a summons' cooldown rising with
#   its count (the game raises a short one, so a later tier must not rest on a
#   shorter cooldown); five tiers that each give more.
# The bar: pictures Fine or better (a template, Masterwork); each `say` finds
#   this wish and no other.
wish golden-devils | Golden Devils
kind spell
say tiny golden devils that explode | golden imps | exploding devils | a devil swarm
tier summon 2 swarm; cooldown 8 :: Two golden devils hunt and burst.
tier summon 3 swarm; cooldown 12 :: Three golden devils hunt and burst.
tier summon 4 swarm; cooldown 16 :: Four golden devils hunt and burst.
tier summon 5 swarm; cooldown 20 :: Five golden devils hunt and burst.
tier summon 6 swarm; cooldown 24 :: Six golden devils, a whole swarm, hunt and burst.
draw summon
